        <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>A reference to an object of a type derived from class <computeroutput><ref refid="classthrust_1_1system_1_1error__category" kindref="compound">error_category</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>The object&apos;s <computeroutput>default_error_condition</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>equivalent</computeroutput> virtual functions shall behave as specified for the class <computeroutput><ref refid="classthrust_1_1system_1_1error__category" kindref="compound">error_category</ref></computeroutput>. The object&apos;s <computeroutput>name</computeroutput> virtual function shall return a pointer to the string <computeroutput>&quot;generic&quot;</computeroutput>. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
